00:03:13.623 --> 00:03:14.510
These are your waters?

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.430
Thank you gentlemen.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.663
I don't want to say my
waters, but like (laughs).

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:19.889
