00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.270
And she's just a layperson.

00:09:18.125 --> 00:09:20.080
(men laugh)

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.797
Not like that, I didn't mean that.

00:09:23.794 --> 00:09:25.730
For me, it's actually
the most important thing

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:29.063
Of course, I'm getting jealous now here.

00:09:29.063 --> 00:09:29.896
What's that?

00:09:29.896 --> 00:09:32.403
No, that's mine, too.
(Martin laughs)

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.863
Why don't you stick to your party, pal?

00:09:35.863 --> 00:09:37.722
(audience laughs)

00:09:37.722 --> 00:09:38.901
Nah, here you go.

00:09:38.901 --> 00:09:40.402
Have fun.

00:09:40.402 --> 00:09:41.485
There you go.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.550
Yay.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:46.703
You say tomato, I say tom-ah-to.

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:49.423
Oh, that's good.

00:09:49.423 --> 00:09:52.840
I'm glad you're saying this
Vichy Catalan is super salty

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.230
and actually you would
go into a restaurant

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.000
and they would just have the one brand.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:56.833
Okay.

00:09:56.833 --> 00:09:57.740
And maybe it's that.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.880
What you want, your
dream is to train people

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.470
to be disappointed by the
kind of water they're getting

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:03.890
in a restaurant.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:06.293
No, I don't leave, I get options.

00:10:06.293 --> 00:10:07.520
There's a bug flying around.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.354
This bug is trying to end this segment.

00:10:09.354 --> 00:10:10.912
(men laugh)

00:10:10.912 --> 00:10:12.962
Hopefully it doesn't drown.

00:10:12.962 --> 00:10:14.120
Hey, listen.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:15.450
That is all the time we have for you.

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.530
But, Martin, you know what I do?

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:17.960
I respect your passion.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.010
I respect your passion.
Thank you.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.030
I don't see the difference myself,

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.002
but I know it's there.

00:10:22.002 --> 00:10:23.190
At least you saw it in one water.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.023
What's that?

00:10:24.023 --> 00:10:25.010
At least you saw it by this one water.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:26.594
Yeah, the one you threw asprin in.

00:10:26.594 --> 00:10:29.511
(audience laughs)

